<title>USA: CRA buys Prompt Associates for $30 mln.</title>
<headline>CRA buys Prompt Associates for $30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRA Managed Care Inc said it bought Prompt Associates Inc for $30 million cash.</p>
<p>Prompt provides inpatient and outpatient bill review services to the health-care marketplace for claims that fall outside of a payor's network of hospitals or outpatient facilities.</p>
<p>Based in Salt Lake City, Utah, Prompt had annual revenues of more than $10 million for its fiscal year ended December 31, 1995, CRA said.</p>
</text>
